razzfazz.ai Service Stack — Licensing Overview
==============================================

Copyright © 2024–2026 razzfazz.ai GmbH – Member of SEQIS Group, Vienna, Austria.
Licensing contact: licensing@razzfazz.ai

The razzfazz.ai Service Stack is distributed under an OPEN-CORE model. Three
kinds of material live in this repository, each under its own licence. The
authoritative, machine-readable mapping of every component to its licence is
`stack.yaml` (fields `license` / `edition` / `built_from`); the razzfazz-licenses
web UI (license.<your-domain>) renders it, and `NOTICE` lists the third-party
attributions.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Community — Apache License 2.0  (OPEN SOURCE)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Our first-party wiring, configuration templates, documentation, build recipes,
and base model wiring — everything marked `edition: community` /
`SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0`. This is genuine Open Source: you may use
it in production, freely and at no charge. Full text: `LICENSE-APACHE`.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. rzfz.ai Subscription — Business Source License 1.1  (SOURCE-AVAILABLE)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Our first-party application and orchestration code — the Configuration/Help/
Licenses/Start portals, the shared runtime library, Model Sync, Backup
Management, the Agent Manager and MCP Manager, and the razzfazz.ai orchestration
surface (scripts/, cli/, provisioning, migrations, security-review tooling,
Authentik SSO provisioning templates) — everything carrying an
`SPDX-License-Identifier: BUSL-1.1` header. Commercial production use of these
components is governed by the rzfz.ai Subscription.

The Business Source License 1.1 is SOURCE-AVAILABLE, **not** an OSI-approved
Open Source licence. You may read, copy, modify and make NON-PRODUCTION use of
it freely. Private, personal and evaluation use is free — no subscription and no
registration. COMMERCIAL PRODUCTION use requires a valid rzfz.ai
Subscription: a licence (not a service) to run the current, patched Stack
commercially — installation, updates and support are separate offerings. A
subscription valid when a version was released permanently authorizes commercial
production use of that version. No license key is required — the containers run
freely; the subscription governs permitted use, not technical function. On the
version's Change Date it converts to Apache-2.0 regardless. For Version 2026.07-ga
the Change Date is 2029-07-08 (release date + 3 years); the per-version schedule
is `config/manifests/license-dates.json`. Full text and the filled BSL parameters:
`LICENSE-BSL`.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Third-party / upstream components — their own upstream licences
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The stack bundles or builds many independent upstream projects, each running as
its own container (mere aggregation — they are not linked into our code). Each
keeps its own licence (Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD, PostgreSQL, MPL-2.0, LGPL-3.0,
GPL-3.0, AGPL-3.0, …), marked `license: upstream:<SPDX>` in `stack.yaml`. We do
NOT relicense them. Attribution, versions/tags, and (for GPL/AGPL images) a
version-pinned reference to the Corresponding Source are in `NOTICE`.

Notable conditions carried through:
  - Dify is Apache-2.0 with additional conditions (no multi-tenant use; the Dify
    logo/copyright must remain in the web image). We ship Dify Community Edition
    in compliance with those conditions — single-tenant, branding preserved — and
    pass through Dify's own licence (modules/dify/DIFY-LICENSE). See
    THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and docs/LICENSING.md.
  - AGPL-3.0 (Vaultwarden, SearXNG, Synapse, Element) and GPL-3.0 (Komodo,
    paperless-ngx) components are shipped UNMODIFIED. See docs/LICENSING.md for
    how that keeps §13 / copyleft clean.

